      "message": "Is there something particularly wrong with a 1:1 relationship?\n\nWhat if project/Android.bp file includes say other/Common.bp? Wouldn\u0027t any rules in other/Common.bp be in the `other` not the `project` package?\n\nI\u0027m thinking in particular of the libcore/JavaLibrary.bp file.",
